Subject: winegstreamer, mf: list cameras and read them in Media Foundation

MFEnumDeviceSources always said there was no camera and MFCreateDeviceSource
was a stub, so programs that take the camera through Media Foundation saw
none. Cameras now come from GStreamer's v4l2 device provider, with the
formats and rates they really give (NV12, YUY2, MJPG...); a size a camera
only gives as MJPG also gets a decoded NV12 type. WINE_GST_TEST_CAMERA=<name>
adds a test pattern camera through the same path.
---
